        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko muri bo harimw’ abagabo banyegetera mu mazu, bagatwara abagore batagira imitima, baremerewe n’ivyaha, batwarwa n’ukwifuza kw’ uburyo bginshi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
