        },
        {
          "text": "no guhamwa, n’imibabaro, nk’ivyambereyeko muri Antiyokiya no muri Ikoniyo n’i Lusitira; ivyo nihanganiye vyose mpamwa, kandi vyose Umwami wacu arabinkiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.11",
